<title>BELGIUM: BBL UPS 1997 GDP GROWTH FORECAST TO 2.2 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>BBL UPS 1997 GDP GROWTH FORECAST TO 2.2 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) has increased its forecast for Belgian GDP growth in 1997 to 2.2 percent from 1.9 percent, the bank said in a statement. </p>
<p>The bank said that private consumption and investments were showing steady growth while industrial activity was starting to pick up.</p>
<p>For 1996, the bank forecasts  growth of 1.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
